+ * and field that those functions write for the tunnel is in the register lists and masks of both
+ * pools, as in that of DCN 4.0.1 (the fields without a mask are those of functions they do not use,
+ * of the clocks of the DPP and of the debug option cm_in_bypass). Three blocks are never programmed
+ * by DC on DCN and keep what the VBIOS or a reset left: the pre-CSC of the format converter, the
